OL,3,GNEWSABuilding suffers partial roof
OL,4,Acollapse in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire that caused "significant" damage
OL,7,Fto a commercial building, including a
OL,8,Fpartial roof collapse, has been brough
OL,9,Funder control, said the fire service.
OL,11,FThe blaze broke out at the building off
OL,12,FMicheldever Road in Whitchurch,
OL,13,FHampshire, shortly before 15:00 BST on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FAt the height of the fire, 12 fire
OL,17,Fengines, two aerial ladder platforms
OL,18,Fand specialist vehicles were sent to
OL,19,Ftackle the flames.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
