OL,3,GNEWSABuilding suffers partial roof
OL,4,Acollapse in fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrews remained at the site overnight,
OL,7,Fdealing with hotspots and monitoring
OL,8,Fthe building. The cause of the fire was
OL,9,Fnot yet know, said Hampshire & Isle of
OL,10,FWight Fire & Rescue Service (HIWFRS).
